  "details": "To illustrate, guess which one is the correct docs for udon sharp:\n\n- https://udonsharp.docs.vrchat.com/vrchat-api/\n\n- https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds\n\n- https://wiki.vrchat.com/wiki/Udon\n\n- https://ask.vrchat.com/c/guides/39\n\nGuess where are the announcements / dev blogs / patch notes:\n\n- https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/recent-releases\n\n- https://ask.vrchat.com/c/official/official-notes/60\n\n- https://ask.vrchat.com/latest\n\n- https://wiki.vrchat.com/wiki/Template:MainPageUpdates\n\nGuess where to give feedback or discussion:\n\n- https://ask.vrchat.com/c/official/31\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/website\n\n- https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us\n\n- the official discord\n\nWhy is the \"website\" such a fragmented, Kafkaesque amalgamation of so many different locations, it is impossible to navigate, nor giving meaningful feedback on.\n\nAnd evidently, impossible to maintain.",
